        <p class="career-rail-label" style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">Core Focus</p>
        <ul class="focus-list">
          <li class="focus-item">
            <strong>Engineering Transformation</strong>
            <span>Decoupling legacy monoliths, removing team duplication, and matching operating tempo to architectural layers.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="focus-item">
            <strong>Agent-Era Communications</strong>
            <span>API boundaries, machine-to-machine identity, and trust when autonomous agents interact across human channels.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="focus-item">
            <strong>Applied AI in Production</strong>
            <span>Designing specifications, test suites, and hybrid architectures that contain probabilistic model behavior safely.</span>
